\centering
\caption{Specificity control: trajectory disruption from ablating top-24 vs.\ bottom-24 L1 heads (ranked by instruction attention fraction). Top-24 produces disproportionately larger effects ($d$ ratio $1.15\times$, KL ratio $1.56\times$), consistent with graded, attention-ordered contribution to routing.}
